[gd_scene format=3 uid="uid://unit_item_list_scroll"]

; One variable: the rows overflow the list. The first list has six rows in 80 px (the vertical bar,
; item_list.cpp:1854-1885), the second adds scroll_hint_mode BOTH (the bottom hint, :1708-1720),
; and the third turns wraparound_items off, so four wide rows overflow sideways (the horizontal
; bar, :1856-1860). The grabbers sit at the top and the left, since a .tscn stores no scroll value.

